# The Vision Digital Video Library.

**Authors:** Gauch, Susan, Li, Wei, Gauch, John

## Abstract
Describes VISION (Video Indexing for Searching over Networks), a digital video prototype developed at the University of Kansas to demonstrate the technology necessary for an online digital video library. Highlights include content-based search and retrieval of video over computer networks; full-text information retrieval; and future plans. (Author/LRW)

**Source:** https://eric.ed.gov/?id=EJ550798

